      <abstract>
        <para>sudo is a command-line utility on &productname; that allows regular users to temporarily execute administrative commands with superuser privileges. By enabling users to run specific tasks as root without switching user accounts or sharing superuser credentials, sudo enhances system security, prevents accidental system-wide modifications, and provides comprehensive command logging.</para>
<para><emphasis>Prerequisites</emphasis></para>
<itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Root or sudo privileges on the host system</para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para>The sudo package installed</para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
